However, its the 18 – 34 age group it is targeting. It hopes they will pick up their remote controls,[ press] 8 on Free[view], 117 on Sky or 159 on Virgin to view their new channel.
The new 24 hour TV channel promises it will be smart, fun and “[inside] London” making a big difference to Londoners lives. It is backed by the Russian owner of the[ Evening] Standard and The[ Independent], Evgeny Le[bed]ev. He believes it will succeed even though previous attempts failed.
